(1) 1209/       0 :                     												;	bit 0 = if set, the game goes to the space screen
(1) 1210/       0 :                     												;	bit 1 = if set, random battles are enabled
(1) 1211/       0 :                     												;	bit 2 = if set, you cannot control the characters
(1) 1212/       0 :                     												;	bit 3 = set during screen fade-out; this will automatically move the characters during scene transitions
