(1) 1218/       0 :                     												;	bit 0 = seems to be unused
(1) 1219/       0 :                     												;	bit 1 = if set, the game enters the battle screen
(1) 1220/       0 :                     												;	bit 2 = if set, the game goes into script mode
(1) 1221/       0 :                     												;	bit 3 = if set, the game will enter the characters menu
(1) 1222/       0 :                     												;	bit 4 = if set, the game will force scene reload
(1) 1223/       0 :                     												;	bit 5 = if set, the game will load the starting data (e.g. scene and coordinates) for the current generation; seems to be unused
