    1098/     EE4 :                     	; There's no check if the character's item number is 0. d6 which now holds the number of items will be subtracted and repeat the step right below because it needs to
    1099/     EE4 :                     	; loop through every item. If it's 0, it will subtract 2 and it will result in a negative number and it will loop many items and overwrite some other RAM addresses.
    1100/     EE4 :                     	; This bug is known as the Pron Glitch.
    1101/     EE4 :                     	; Add a test for 0 right here and branch to the part that subtracts $20 to d7 so that it processes the next character's items.
