   38970/   1E52C :                     
   38971/   1E52C :                     ; ===========================================================
   38972/   1E52C :                     ; Technique Power Growth
   38973/   1E52C :                     ;
   38974/   1E52C :                     ; When a bit is set to 1, technique level will increase. Each character
   38975/   1E52C :                     ; will start from one of addresses below. The offset depends on the
   38976/   1E52C :                     ; character's level. So for example, if you start from loc_1E536, you will
   38977/   1E52C :                     ; see the following:
   38978/   1E52C :                     ;
   38979/   1E52C :                     ;	%01001001
   38980/   1E52C :                     ;
   38981/   1E52C :                     ; If you reach level 2, then the 2nd bit from the left is picked: that's set
   38982/   1E52C :                     ; to 1, so technique level will grow.
   38983/   1E52C :                     ; ===========================================================
