   75874/   3DAE0 :                     ; =================================================================
   75875/   3DAE0 :                     ; Window data related to shop/system messages on that screen
   75876/   3DAE0 :                     ;	word 1 - x position
   75877/   3DAE0 :                     ;	word 2 - y position
   75878/   3DAE0 :                     ;	word 3 - width
   75879/   3DAE0 :                     ;	word 4 - height (use even numbers)
   75880/   3DAE0 :                     ;	word 5 - ???
   75881/   3DAE0 :                     ;	word 6 - ???
   75882/   3DAE0 :                     ; -------------------
   75883/   3DAE0 :                     ; Notes:
   75884/   3DAE0 :                     ; - the numbers are finicky and if the values are extreme, it breaks boxes and how text strings are read
   75885/   3DAE0 :                     ; - x/y values actually cut off the window display if altered alone
   75886/   3DAE0 :                     ; - suspected width value (3rd listed) broke the game ... probable that it wasn't centered enough to accommodate expansion
